# What plugins/vpn/init.lua needs, declared beside the file that consumes it. Format is
# name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Olm's lib/deps.lua for the kinds and for how these files are found.
#
# core is not a tool to install, it is a capability the composition root hands this file
# from Olm's own lib, so this line decides injection rather than installation. Optional,
# because only the resting order of the location list degrades without it, the panel still
# opens and still connects.
recency | core | lib/recency.lua | optional | remembering the last used city, so the list opens already ordered by that
